  "id": "cultural-sensitivity",
  "term": "cultural sensitivity",
  "definition": "Cultural sensitivity is a learnable capacity for navigating cultural differences in diverse, globalized settings. In this source, it is treated as a skill closely linked with intercultural empathy and as especially important for teachers in bilingual or international classrooms.",
